  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Winter Warmer - Homelessness Relief - Australia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Did you know that Tweed Shire, NSW has the highest number of people sleeping rough compared to other LGAs in the state?  Winter Warmer is a campaign aimed at helping the homeless community in the Northern Rivers region of Australia during the winter season.  With winter approaching and homeless communities facing the challenges of sleeping rough in cold, wet, and harsh conditions, we have an opportunity to make a difference in their lives.  Bringing hope and warmth to our homeless communities.</narrative>
  </description>
